---
import TreatmentLayout from '../../components/TreatmentLayout.astro';
import PriceBlock from '../../components/PriceBlock.astro';
import { gracefullyGrey } from '../../data/services';
import { images } from '../../data/images';
---

<TreatmentLayout
  title="Grey Hair"
  metaTitle="Gracefully Grey: grey-hair transition and care"
  description="Gracefully Grey at Maison Coiffure: a personal consultation (€25, deducted from your first treatment) and a personalised plan to embrace natural grey or transition from coloured hair."
  lede="Embrace your natural grey, or grow it out gradually, at your own pace."
  image={images.greyBob}
  ctaLabel="Book a Gracefully Grey consultation"
  waMessage="Hello Maison Coiffure, I would like to book a Gracefully Grey consultation."
>
  <p>
    The Gracefully Grey plan supports clients who want to embrace their natural grey or gradually
    move away from coloured hair. The objective is a considered transition that suits your current
    colour, condition, preferences and pace.
  </p>
  <p>
    Tonal work can soften the contrast between regrowth and coloured lengths, refine cool, grey and
    ash tones, and neutralise unwanted warmth, without losing what makes your hair yours.
  </p>
  <p>
    Everything starts with a personal consultation. We assess the regrowth, existing colour and
    condition, and agree a treatment plan that may include highlights, lowlights, colour blending,
    colour removal or toning. You then receive a personal quotation for the agreed plan; there is no
    generic price for work this personal.
  </p>

  <Fragment slot="after">
    <PriceBlock group={gracefullyGrey} headingLevel="h2" />
  </Fragment>
</TreatmentLayout>
